license: MIT
abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.6.0 adds semantic transcript presentation, accessible grounded sources, an explicitly requested and source-revalidated GISTEMP chart path, and session-only qualified repository optimizations that default to OFF. It retains explicit Save to History, exact-context restore, hardened SQLite state and exact-SHA provenance."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
  - retrieval
  - provenance
  - scientific models
  - dynamical models
  - natural-language interface
  - research software
